Official mobile app of Moscow Airport Domodedovo (DME) allows you to:

- quickly access to airport’s flight information such as schedule, departure and arrival times, gate numbers and more;
- find full information on airport’s services provided for passengers;
- obtain specific information on services provided for people with disabilities.

Moscow Domodedovo Airport is one of the largest international airports in Russia, serving 30.5 mln passengers in 2015. The best airport in Russia and the CIS, according to Skytrax. Domodedovo was chosen by leading global airline alliances – Star Alliance and oneworld – for flights to Moscow.

The easiest, most convenient way to book a taxi in the Stafford and surrounding area. Download the Smart Cars taxi application and make your booking now!
The app tells you exactly how long your car will take to arrive. 
App features:
- The easiest and fastest way to book a taxi;
- Business and personal use;
- No need to type in your pick-up address - GPS system finds your current location ;
- Remembers recent addresses for faster repeat bookings;
- Airport, railways, nights out bookings;
- Tells you how long your car will take to arrive;
- Get a notification when your taxi arrives;
- Safe and flexible modes of payment;
- Receive a text message with the car’s details and driver’s mobile number.
